    `s 663(3) states the total number of shares of the class` IS TRUE
    `s 663(3) states the aggregate nominal value of the shares of the class` IS FALSE

GIVEN a IS A BOOLEAN, b IS A BOOLEAN, c IS A BOOLEAN, entries IS A LIST OF `s 663(3) class entry`
GIVETH A `s 663(3) statement of capital`
`fixture: a statement of capital` MEANS `s 663(3) statement of capital` WITH
    `s 663(3) states the total number of shares of the company` IS a
    `s 663(3) states the aggregate nominal value of those shares` IS b
    `s 663(3) states the aggregate amount unpaid on those shares` IS c
    `s 663(3) entries for the classes of shares` IS entries

