-- ---- s 668 ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

`fixture: private company, shares forfeited, re-registered` MEANS `s 668(1) shares held by or for a private company` WITH
    `s 668(1) how the shares came to be held` IS `s 668(1)(a) forfeited in pursuance of the company's articles or surrendered to the company in lieu of forfeiture`
    `s 668(1)(b) to (d) the company has a beneficial interest in the shares` IS FALSE
    `s 668(1) the company is re-registered as a public company after that` IS TRUE

`fixture: private company, shares forfeited, not re-registered` MEANS `s 668(1) shares held by or for a private company` WITH
    `s 668(1) how the shares came to be held` IS `s 668(1)(a) forfeited in pursuance of the company's articles or surrendered to the company in lieu of forfeiture`
    `s 668(1)(b) to (d) the company has a beneficial interest in the shares` IS FALSE
    `s 668(1) the company is re-registered as a public company after that` IS FALSE

`fixture: private company, acquired by a nominee, beneficial interest` MEANS `s 668(1) shares held by or for a private company` WITH
    `s 668(1) how the shares came to be held` IS `s 668(1)(c) acquired by a nominee of the company from a third party without financial assistance given by the company`
    `s 668(1)(b) to (d) the company has a beneficial interest in the shares` IS TRUE
    `s 668(1) the company is re-registered as a public company after that` IS TRUE

`fixture: private company, acquired by a nominee, no beneficial interest` MEANS `s 668(1) shares held by or for a private company` WITH
    `s 668(1) how the shares came to be held` IS `s 668(1)(c) acquired by a nominee of the company from a third party without financial assistance given by the company`
    `s 668(1)(b) to (d) the company has a beneficial interest in the shares` IS FALSE
    `s 668(1) the company is re-registered as a public company after that` IS TRUE

`fixture: private company, another way` MEANS `s 668(1) shares held by or for a private company` WITH
    `s 668(1) how the shares came to be held` IS `s 668(1) in another way`
    `s 668(1)(b) to (d) the company has a beneficial interest in the shares` IS TRUE
    `s 668(1) the company is re-registered as a public company after that` IS TRUE

