#ASSERT `s 668(1) this section applies to the shares` `fixture: private company, acquired by a nominee, no beneficial interest` EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 668(1) this section applies to the shares` `fixture: private company, another way` EQUALS JUST FALSE
